<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Beatrix Q2 distrib income slides.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Beatrix Q2 distrib income slides.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus</p>
<p>preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib income			   43.14 vs 49.14</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 40.49 vs 39.48</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 3,811 vs 3,777</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		651,000 vs 614,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     5.9 vs 6.2</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  33,041 vs 33,995</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     52,953 vs 52,507</p>
<p>Full name: Beatrix Mines Ltd, managed by Gengold Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
